  "goodToKnow": "Skurril means bizarre, quirky or odd, often in an amusing way: ein skurriler Typ, skurrile Gesetze, eine skurrile Geschichte. It comes from Latin scurra (jester). Synonyms: seltsam, kauzig (eccentric), absonderlich, schräg (colloquial). Germany's Loriot was a master of skurrile everyday humour in sketches like the duck in the bathtub."
